OL,3,GNEWSACustomers to get compensation for
OL,4,Awater outages
OL,5,
OL,6,FCustomers who lost their water supplies
OL,7,Fare to get #50 compensation, a water
OL,8,Fcompany has confirmed.
OL,10,FLast Thursday, 36,000 customers in
OL,11,FScunthorpe and the surrounding area
OL,12,Fwere left with no supply or low
OL,13,Fpressure.
OL,15,FAccording to Anglian Water, the problem
OL,16,Fwas caused by two pipes bursting, which
OL,17,Fprevented water flowing into a local
OL,18,Fstorage reservoir. Most of the water
OL,19,Fsupply was restored by Friday.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
