OL,3,GNEWSACustomers to get compensation for
OL,4,Awater outages
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmma Staples, the company's director of
OL,7,Fcorporate affairs, apologised for the
OL,8,Fdisruption caused, adding: "If they
OL,9,F[customers] have been off for over 12
OL,10,Fhours, then they will be credited to
OL,11,Ftheir bill with #50."
